格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Unlimited memory for OpenClaw","id":"gh:1175756746","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"mem9","slug":"mem9-ai/mem9","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Unlimited memory for OpenClaw"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Persistent Memory for AI Agents."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Your agents forget everything between sessions. mem9 fixes that with persistent memory across sessio"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ns and machines, shared memory for multi-agent workflows, and hybrid recall with a visual dashboard."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"For OpenClaw and ClawHub installs, start here: mem9.ai/openclaw-memory"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Hermes Agent, Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, DeepSeek Harness, and Dify guides are below."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"1. Choose your mem9 endpoint."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Hosted API: `https://api.mem9.ai`\n- Self-hosted: apply the matching control-plane schema, then sta"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ps://api.mem9.ai`\n- Self-hosted: apply the matching control-plane schema, then start `mnemo-server`:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"See Self-Hosting for backend-specific setup details, and API Reference for provisioning."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"2. Pick your integration guide."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- OpenClaw / ClawHub\n- Hermes Agent\n- Claude Code\n- OpenCode\n- Codex\n- DeepSeek Harness\n- Dify\n- Any"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" HTTP client / custom runtime"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"3. Set your credentials."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"For self-hosted deployments, use your server URL and the mem9 API key returned or configured by your"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"loyments, use your server URL and the mem9 API key returned or configured by your provisioning flow."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Why mem9"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"mem9 gives coding agents one shared memory layer instead of separate local notebooks and one-off pro"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" coding agents one shared memory layer instead of separate local notebooks and one-off prompt files."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| What mem9 gives you | Why it matters |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Persistent memory across sessions and machines | Your context survives restarts, laptop switches, "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"and long-running projects |\n| Shared memory across agents and workflow platforms | OpenClaw, Hermes "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"Agent, Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, DeepSeek Harness, Dify apps, and custom clients can recall the "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"same facts |\n| Stateless integrations | Runtime plugins stay thin because storage, search, ingest, a"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"nd policy live in the server |\n| Hybrid recall and a visual dashboard | Semantic search, keyword sea"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"rch, and inspection workflows stay in one system |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Supported Platforms and Agent Runtimes"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Platform | Integration shape | Install / docs |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| OpenClaw | `kind: \"memory\"` plugin for server-backed shared memory | OpenClaw / ClawHub install gu"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ide |\n| Hermes Agent | Memory provider plugin with setup and activation flow | mem9-hermes-plugin RE"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ADME |\n| Claude Code | Marketplace plugin with hooks and skills | `claude-plugin/README.md` |\n| Open"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"Code | Plugin SDK integration loaded from `opencode.json` | `opencode-plugin/README.md` |\n| Codex | "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"Marketplace plugin with managed hooks and project overrides | `codex-plugin/README.md` |\n| DeepSeek "},{"id":"p22s6","text":"Harness | Native DSH/Cordis bundle with recall, smart ingest, and memory tools | `dsh-plugin/README."},{"id":"p22s7","text":"md` |\n| Dify | Tool plugin for Dify Agent apps and Workflow apps, with single-space and multi-space "},{"id":"p22s8","text":"authorization | mem9-dify-plugin README |\n| Any HTTP client / custom runtime | Direct REST API integ"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"ration | API Reference |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"All supported runtimes and platform integrations expose the same core memory flow: store, search, ge"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"t, update, and delete against the mem9 server API."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Why the Hosted API"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The hosted mem9 API is the fastest way to put persistent memory behind an agent fleet while keeping "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"the option to self-host later."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Hosted API capability | Why teams start here |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Hosted mem9 API with instant space provisioning | You can install an agent integration first and s"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"kip standing up infrastructure on day one |\n| Shared memory across runtimes and platforms | One spac"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"e can serve OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, DeepSeek Harness, Dify apps, and c"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ustom clients together |\n| Managed search and storage | Hybrid recall works out of the box without a"},{"id":"p27s5","text":" separate vector stack or sync layer |\n| TiDB Cloud Starter foundation | The hosted path benefits fr"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"om instant provisioning, native vector search, full-text search, server-side auto-embedding, hybrid "},{"id":"p27s7","text":"search, and MySQL-compatible operational semantics |\n| Same API contract as self-hosted mem9 | Movin"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"g to your own deployment is a base-URL and credential change, not a plugin rewrite |\n| Visual dashbo"},{"id":"p27s9","text":"ard and product onboarding | Teams can inspect and manage memory without building internal tooling f"},{"id":"p27s10","text":"d product onboarding | Teams can inspect and manage memory without building internal tooling first |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Under the hood, the hosted mem9 API runs the same mem9 server model surfaced in this repository, wit"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"h TiDB Cloud Starter providing managed provisioning, native vector search, full-text search, server-"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"side auto-embedding, hybrid search, and MySQL-compatible storage semantics."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## API Reference"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Set `X-Mnemo-Agent-Id` on authenticated memory, import, and session-message requests when you want t"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"he server to distinguish which runtime or agent instance is writing and recalling memories inside th"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"e same mem9 space. This works on both the tenant-path `v1alpha1` routes and the `v1alpha2` API-key r"},{"id":"p30s4","text":" mem9 space. This works on both the tenant-path `v1alpha1` routes and the `v1alpha2` API-key routes."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Provisioning"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Use this endpoint when you want mem9 to auto-provision a new TiDB-backed space."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Method | Path | Description |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"#### Security And Debugging"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Variable | Required | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| `MNEMO_ENCRYPT_TYPE` | No | `plain` | Encryption type for tenant DB passwords: `plain`, `md5`, or "},{"id":"p37s2","text":"`kms`. One-time deployment decision. |\n| `MNEMO_ENCRYPT_WRITE_FORMAT` | No | `legacy` | Write format"},{"id":"p37s3","text":" for control-plane secrets: `legacy` preserves current `MNEMO_ENCRYPT_TYPE` behavior; `enc_v1` encry"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"pts new values with the keyring mounted at `MNEMO_SPACE_CREDENTIAL_KEYRING_FILE` and requires `secre"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"t_field_kids` to map every protected field to one distinct non-Space encryption key. Existing values"},{"id":"p37s6","text":" remain readable in either mode, and switching back to `legacy` after enabling `enc_v1` is safe for "},{"id":"p37s7","text":"reads because readers understand both formats. Enable `enc_v1` only after every instance runs a vers"},{"id":"p37s8","text":"ion that reads it; once `enc_v1` values exist, do not roll back to a binary that predates this setti"},{"id":"p37s9","text":"ng. |\n| `MNEMO_ENCRYPT_KEY` | No | — | Encryption key for `md5` or KMS key ID for `kms`. Required wh"},{"id":"p37s10","text":"en `MNEMO_ENCRYPT_TYPE` is not `plain` |\n| `MNEMO_DEBUG_LLM` | No | `false` | Log raw LLM responses "},{"id":"p37s11","text":"for debugging parse errors. Use only in dev/test because responses may contain user data |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
